Alongside the lineup, this year The Brit List has also announced Disney+ as its headline sponsor.

&#8220;In 2026, The Brit List and Disney+ will go further than ever before to support the great British writing talent of the future,&#8221; said Brit List founder and director Alexandra Arlango. &#8220;We look forward to introducing this year's writers to the team at Disney+ and to our returning partners, Audible and the Film Distributors Association."

