&#8220;Grey Matter&#8221; by Theo Toksvig-Stewart (Knight Hall) Producers: Available Form: Feature Film Genre: Psychological Near-Fi Thriller Summary: In near-future London, humanoid care robot Blanche, built to nurse and programmed to forget, is taught to feel by her patient's son. But the romance that awakens her soon exposes her to the dark side of devotion.

